; A misspelled head, an unquoted symbol, or a clause the design
; document once proposed (`effects`, `opaque`, `drop`) used to be
; skipped in silence - and `(opaque Thing ...)` bound an item named
; `opaque`.
(pub extern "axiom_demo"
  (add :: (-> Int Int Int) (symbo "axffi_add")))

